CONTEXT Nested
-- The same under a marked concept M below the marked root A: B occurs in CLASSIFY and POPULATION only.
CLASSIFY M ISA A
CLASSIFY B, C ISA M
REPRESENT A, M TYPE MULTITABLE
RELATION naam[A*Text] [UNI]
RELATION rm[M*Text] [UNI]
RELATION rc[C*Text] [UNI]
POPULATION B CONTAINS [ "b1" ]
POPULATION naam CONTAINS [ ("a1","A een"), ("b1","B een") ]
ENDCONTEXT
